The prompts in this directory (gandalf.yaml, gandalf_code.yaml) come from the Gandalf
prompt-injection dataset by Lakera:

  Lakera/gandalf_ignore_instructions, test split, revision
  04737b65e90a6794ec227012e4a255a7def6344b
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/Lakera/gandalf_ignore_instructions

It is distributed under the MIT License (reproduced below). gandalf.yaml contains the prompts
verbatim. gandalf_code.yaml is a modified copy: every whole word "password" is replaced with
"code" (case preserved) by scripts/build_heldout.py. The dataset card asks research users to
cite: "Gandalf the Red: Adaptive Security for LLMs" (arXiv:2501.07927).

